**Key .NET 11 APIs used:**

| Method | Returns | Throws if missing? |
|--------|---------|-------------------|
| `options.GetTypeInfo<T>()` | `JsonTypeInfo<T>` | ✅ Yes |
| `options.TryGetTypeInfo<T>(out …)` | `bool` | ❌ No — returns `false` |

Both give you a `JsonTypeInfo<T>` directly — no manual cast from the non-generic base needed.
